      "end": 5.033,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "美好的城市环境呢，他说离不开这个环卫工人的默默的付出，",
      "score": 0.0861,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1447,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1348,
        "sc_delta": 0.0099,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.025,
        "seg_cer": 0.16,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "美好的城市环境呢，它是离不开这个环卫公益的默默的付出。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 5.148,
      "end": 8.526,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "好辛苦的啊！在这个香山区中山南路，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0112,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0059,
        "sc_delta": 0.0053,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "好辛苦的啊！在这个香山区中山南路。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 8.849,
      "end": 11.792,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "他呢，那个就从事一家这个米粉店，",
      "score": 0.1259,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2526,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1857,
        "sc_delta": 0.0669,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.116,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "他呢？那个就郑州一家这个米粉店。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 11.853,
      "end": 16.524,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "人家呢是用另一种方式来表达啊，对这些环卫工人的敬意。",
      "score": 0.0762,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0405,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0323,
        "sc_delta": 0.0082,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.167,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "人家呢是用另外一种方式来表达啊，对这环卫公益的敬意。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 16.786,
      "end": 20.3,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "店主陈建国、陈建军兄妹两个啊，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0544,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0767,
        "sc_delta": -0.0223,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "店主陈建国、陈建军兄妹两个啊。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 20.3,
      "end": 23.913,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "用实惠为这个环卫工啊节省开支。",
      "score": 0.16,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0094,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0114,
        "sc_delta": -0.002,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.357,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "用是非为这个反围攻啊，节省开支。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 24.143,
      "end": 28.118,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "你凡说啊，到了个店里来吃米粉的这些环卫工人呢，",
      "score": 0.4726,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.8238,
        "sc_logprob": -0.8154,
        "sc_delta": 0.0085,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.601,
        "seg_cer": 0.429,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "你凡数啊，到那个店头来吃米粉的人，范围广一呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 28.417,
      "end": 31.58,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "规定那里啊一律是三块半，而且呢",
      "score": 0.5041,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.8954,
        "sc_logprob": -0.8792,
        "sc_delta": 0.0162,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.662,
        "seg_cer": 0.357,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "规定大家哈，一律是三块一万，而且呢。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 31.734,
      "end": 34.39,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "也是一天是就节省两点多。",
      "score": 0.68,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -5.8296,
        "sc_logprob": -5.8418,
        "sc_delta": -0.0121,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.909,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "人家这一件事啊，就坚持了两年多。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 34.676,
      "end": 37.654,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这家米粉店呢，在中山南路，面积不大，",
      "score": 0.0705,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0082,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0102,
        "sc_delta": -0.0021,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.067,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "咧",
        "text_free": "这家米粉店咧，在中山南路，面积不大。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 37.654,
      "end": 39.951,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "就餐区呢就摆了三张桌子。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0017,
        "sc_logprob": -0.001,
        "sc_delta": 0.0007,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "就餐区呢，就摆了三张桌子。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 40.215,
      "end": 44.479,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "除了普通的食客之外，陆陆续续呢会有环卫工人进店吃粉。",
      "score": 0.2221,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1316,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1363,
        "sc_delta": -0.0048,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.014,
        "seg_cer": 0.333,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.25,
        "phon_examples": "吃/刺 进/经",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "除了普通的食客之外，陆陆续续的，会有范围供应经典刺粉。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 44.729,
      "end": 50.429,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "小小的米粉店，每批做员工都是陈建国、陈建军兄妹，勤力勤为的，",
      "score": 0.2558,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.4958,
        "sc_logprob": -0.4931,
        "sc_delta": 0.0027,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.323,
        "seg_cer": 0.192,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "小小的米粉店，每聘用员工都是陈建国、陈建军两兄妹亲力亲为的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 50.653,
      "end": 54.18,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "一个卖粉，一个配菜。对于环卫工人来讲啊，",
      "score": 0.2057,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2189,
        "sc_logprob": -0.226,
        "sc_delta": -0.0072,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.088,
        "seg_cer": 0.471,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "一个毛分，一个赔钱。对于范围供应来讲啊。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 54.18,
      "end": 56.929,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "这个呢，就和驿站一样的，除了吃粉呢，",
      "score": 0.1381,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2212,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1775,
        "sc_delta": 0.0437,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.09,
        "seg_cer": 0.2,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这跟兰州和驿站一样的，除了吃粉呢。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 56.929,
      "end": 59.879,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "还可以给大家洗着脚。店里呢有空调，",
      "score": 0.2921,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.5702,
        "sc_logprob": -0.5835,
        "sc_delta": -0.0133,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.386,
        "seg_cer": 0.2,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "还可以给大家鞋子着，店里呢有空调。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 59.879,
      "end": 64.497,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "有茶水，免费的开放。环卫工人呢可以进店解水休息。",
      "score": 0.2593,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2767,
        "sc_logprob": -0.312,
        "sc_delta": -0.0353,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.137,
        "seg_cer": 0.333,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.143,
        "phon_examples": "进/景",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "有茶水免费的开放，范围供应呢，可以景点借水休息。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 64.727,
      "end": 67.16,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "那我们就在这经常在这里吃，",
      "score": 0.68,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -6.009,
        "sc_logprob": -5.795,
        "sc_delta": 0.214,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.5,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "我们就手在脚尖嘛，经常在这里。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 67.543,
      "end": 70.647,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "你看每天跟着那个要大块大块的老板，",
      "score": 0.6629,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.5054,
        "sc_logprob": -1.5054,
        "sc_delta": -0.0,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.312,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "你看，每一天给的那个要大块大块的，这个老板。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 70.647,
      "end": 74.52,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "很大方了，给我们天天都吃了大片大片的，要给我们吃。",
      "score": 0.0718,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1368,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1451,
        "sc_delta": -0.0083,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.018,
        "seg_cer": 0.136,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "很大方的，给我们天天都贴了大片大片的药给我们吃。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 74.52,
      "end": 78.012,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "你看，到这我们环卫工辛苦吗？",
      "score": 0.1937,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1918,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2148,
        "sc_delta": -0.0231,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.065,
        "seg_cer": 0.583,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "你看，当时我们环卫跟市人口嘛。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 78.012,
      "end": 81.236,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "每天都来这里吃，都是有为我们，",
      "score": 0.68,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -5.0203,
        "sc_logprob": -4.9937,
        "sc_delta": 0.0265,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.538,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "一天都来这里出差的，就吆喝我们。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 81.269,
      "end": 84.178,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "都记得给你好好看的，给我们的。",
      "score": 0.64,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.2035,
        "sc_logprob": -1.2164,
        "sc_delta": -0.0128,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.923,
        "seg_cer": 0.538,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "老，这个嗯，好好看得起我们的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 84.178,
      "end": 87.036,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "不管是太阳暴晒还是刮风下雨，",
      "score": 0.1241,
